==Finnish==

===Pronunciation===
* {{fi-IPA}}

===Etymology 1===
{{suffix|fi|kuka|kin}}

====Pronoun====
{{head|fi|pronoun}}

# {{lb|fi|indefinite}} [[each]]:
#:* ''Kukin'' [[ne|niistä]] [[maksaa|maksoi]] 50 (= [[viisikymmentä]]) [[sentti]]ä.
#:** '''Each''' of them cost 50 cents.
#:* On noin 250 eri vähemmistöryhmää, joihin ''kuhunkin'' kuuluu alle 100 henkilöä.
#:** There are about 250 different minority groups, to '''each''' of which belongs under 100 people.
#:* ''Kullakin'' yksilöllä on oikeus elämään.
#:** '''Each''' individual has the right to live.

=====Usage notes=====
* ''Kukin'' has also plural forms, which are used e.g. in [[:Category:Finnish pluralia tantum|words that are used only in plural]]: '''kutkin''' [[häät]], '''each''' (of the) wedding(s).

